Comment: 0,0:00:20.26,0:00:25.31,translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}All by my lonesome, I was powerless, and so
Comment: 0,0:00:25.58,0:00:30.81,translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}I really held no kind of value at all
Comment: 0,0:00:30.88,0:00:36.01,translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Faced with that emptiness and drowning in it
Comment: 0,0:00:36.27,0:00:41.93,translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}I was always so anxious about tomorrow
Comment: 0,0:00:42.21,0:00:47.30,translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}And by some random chance, the people I met back then
Comment: 0,0:00:47.58,0:00:52.62,translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Called me their friend without a second thought
Comment: 0,0:00:52.90,0:01:02.05,translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}So I realised something precious to me, dee{\b1}p in my heart
Comment: 0,0:01:02.41,0:01:07.29,translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}When it's for someone's sake, and for their sake alone,
Comment: 0,0:01:07.60,0:01:12.64,translation - 1,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Even a person like me can become a hero at any time
Comment: 0,0:01:13.06,0:01:18.58,translation - 2,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Two stories come together by this miracle
Comment: 0,0:01:18.92,0:01:28.98,translation - 2,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Almost as if someone from the future pulled the string of fate along
Comment: 0,0:01:29.10,0:01:34.48,translation - 2,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}A single emotion transcends even space-time itself
Comment: 0,0:01:34.92,0:01:41.56,translation - 2,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}A seemingly endless light traces the outline of the gate
Comment: 0,0:01:41.69,0:01:55.62,translation - 2,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Reminding me of the "Observer," perhaps I would want to say...
